/E (Another motivating factor is the opportunity to apply machine learning concepts to a real-world problem using actual IPL datasets. Working with large-scale data helps in understanding data preprocessing, feature engineering, and model training in a practical manner. It also enhances technical knowledge by integrating tools such as Python, LightGBM, and Streamlit into a single system. This project not only improves problem-solving skills but also demonstrates how data science can be used effectively in sports analytics. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
