/E (Finally, the project is motivated by the need to combine advanced technology with user-friendly design. Many existing analytical systems are complex and not easily accessible to general users. By developing a simple and interactive interface, this system ensures that even non-technical users can benefit from machine learning predictions. Overall, the project aims to create a balance between technical accuracy and usability, delivering a system that is efficient, reliable, and easy to use. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4]
>>
