437 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 202 0 R
/E (The proposed system, IPL Win Probability Prediction System, is a machine learning-based application designed to simplify and automate the process of predicting match outcomes during Indian Premier League \(IPL\) matches. Users can enter match details such as teams, score, overs, wickets, and target, and obtain real-time win probability predictions, while the system processes data and generates results efficiently. Built with Python for backend processing and Streamlit for the front end, along with LightGBM for prediction, the system provides a responsive, accurate, and user-friendly interface, improving prediction efficiency, reducing manual analysis, and enhancing the overall understanding of match situations. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
